  designNotes: 'A swapper: target friendly creature trades places with its partner
    in the formation, then it and the creatures beside it where it lands get +1 Attack
    and +1 Health for good. Lines up a pair on one lane, or pulls a hurt creature
    out of one.'
  artDescription: 'Two developers squeezed at one tiny desk sharing a single keyboard:
    one types with a coffee in his other hand, the other leans over his shoulder
    pointing at a bug on the screen, a timesheet pinned between them billing 16 hours.'
  defaultTargetType: 3
